{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17323","headline":"送湖南李侍御赴本使赋采菱亭诗 · 权德舆","name":"送湖南李侍御赴本使赋采菱亭诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧俗采菱处，津亭风景和。\n沅江收暮霭，楚女发清歌。\n曲岸萦湘叶，荒堦上白波。\n兰桡向莲府，一爲枉帆过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}